{"5301870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"deep rabbit hole","steam_appid":5301870,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>deep rabbit hole<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the gruesome reality hidden behind hallucinations in this 2D pixel psychological horror game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a psychiatric consultation and a prescription for depression, you must navigate through a grotesque hallucination. Play as a protagonist struggling with their mental state, fighting and fleeing from rabbit-masked entities in the woods. When the delusions finally break, what reality will be left at the end of your blade?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Intense:<\/strong> A concise, roughly 10-minute gameplay experience tightly focused on narrative impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Psychological Horror:<\/strong> A chilling atmosphere built with low-resolution pixel art and in-game dialogue that explores a crumbling mind.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Platforming:<\/strong> 2D side-scrolling action where you jump across platforms, evade, and fight off unsettling threats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Tragic Reality:<\/strong> Experience a single, definitive ending that reveals the shocking truth behind the protagonist's actions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>deep rabbit hole<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the gruesome reality hidden behind hallucinations in this 2D pixel psychological horror game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a psychiatric consultation and a prescription for depression, you must navigate through a grotesque hallucination. Play as a protagonist struggling with their mental state, fighting and fleeing from rabbit-masked entities in the woods. When the delusions finally break, what reality will be left at the end of your blade?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Intense:<\/strong> A concise, roughly 10-minute gameplay experience tightly focused on narrative impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Psychological Horror:<\/strong> A chilling atmosphere built with low-resolution pixel art and in-game dialogue that explores a crumbling mind.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Platforming:<\/strong> 2D side-scrolling action where you jump across platforms, evade, and fight off unsettling threats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Tragic Reality:<\/strong> Experience a single, definitive ending that reveals the shocking truth behind the protagonist's actions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Face the gruesome reality hidden behind hallucinations in this short 2D pixel psychological horror game. Fight and flee from rabbit-masked entities in the woods as a protagonist struggling with their mental state. When the delusions break, what reality will be left at the end of your blade?","supported_languages":"English, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5301870\/23ce78801f5f51535b09d0a7a7400a47d9d78a14\/header.jpg?t=1793693737","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5301870\/9881f22d8c702885d0578b826c1569c0a6cec2d1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793693737","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5301870\/9881f22d8c702885d0578b826c1569c0a6cec2d1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793693737","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><s